WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.450
Here are two names you hear
all the time: Great Britain,

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.170
and the United Kingdom.

3
00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:10.130
People often swap them, as if
they mean exactly the same thing.

4
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:11.330
But do they?

5
00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:14.870
Is Great Britain the same
place as the United Kingdom?

6
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:17.810
In this mission, you'll name
the countries that make up the

7
00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:20.390
United Kingdom, and
find them on a map.

8
00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:24.070
You'll spot its highlands, like
the Pennines, and its rivers,

9
00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.110
like the Thames and the Severn.

10
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:29.670
Then you'll put your whole
map of the world to the test.

11
00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.750
Your mission: find out whether
Great Britain and the United

12
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.150
Kingdom are the same place.
